## 5. 快速参考

### Session选择速查表

| 场景 | Session类型 | 示例 |
|------|------------|------|
| GET请求 | `CurrentSession` | `@router.get()` |
| POST请求 | `CurrentSessionTransaction` | `@router.post()` |
| PUT请求 | `CurrentSessionTransaction` | `@router.put()` |
| DELETE请求 | `CurrentSessionTransaction` | `@router.delete()` |
| 只读查询 | `CurrentSession` | 统计、聚合 |
| 写操作 | `CurrentSessionTransaction` | 创建、更新、删除 |

### CRUD方法检查清单

- [ ] 所有方法都有类型注解
- [ ] 所有方法都有中文Docstring
- [ ] 使用flush而不是commit
- [ ] 不包含业务逻辑
- [ ] 不抛出业务异常
- [ ] 返回Model对象或None
- [ ] 参数命名清晰
- [ ] 查询方法支持分页

### 常用SQLAlchemy查询

```python
# 基本查询
stmt = select(Model).where(Model.id == id)

# 多条件查询
stmt = select(Model).where(
    and_(
        Model.user_id == user_id,
        Model.status == "active"
    )
)

# 或条件
stmt = select(Model).where(
    or_(
        Model.title.ilike(f"%{keyword}%"),
        Model.description.ilike(f"%{keyword}%")
    )
)

# 排序
stmt = select(Model).order_by(Model.created_at.desc())

# 分页
stmt = select(Model).offset(skip).limit(limit)

# 计数
stmt = select(func.count()).where(Model.user_id == user_id)

# Join
stmt = (
    select(Model)
    .join(RelatedModel, Model.related_id == RelatedModel.id)
    .where(RelatedModel.status == "active")
)
```
